{
  "id": "1KI.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Sugoodiga 13",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ging'ulayi, siida ASEETA gwarina Yuda, aba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA jea gawa Beteli. Yeroboamu abeeda ghamiinaada aba heeda wagiida ghaghwarda haleanjeeda ng'andidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooyeawusa siida mida heeda wagiida aba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayi, “Ea heeda wagiida, heeda wagiida, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: ‘Ng'ula, gajeeji orjeeda aba gheeh Dawdi, gajeeguura Yosiya; gaygwasissa badaydaang'u lukghumajeega ashoohoodiga abiita heetiyeada gaygwariida haleanjeeda ng'andidi aba uhuudaang'u nea eara geaka buuneeda gajeegwardeaysa badaydaang'u.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiin giirooraneeda aba eaweedida, ak gwayi, “Nih giirooraneeda ghayi rugu NG'UTAMIIDA gil: ‘Ng'ula, heeda wagiida gayghabwaasha, ak deareeda mida uhuuda gaygaweayeesa ng'eanyi.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy sugoocheanda ng'asheega siida ASEETA, ayeawusa heeda wagiida aba Beteli, ghoadoabiiw Yeroboamu geatindaanyi aba heeda wagiida ak gwayi, “Oong'ooyni.” Ak geatindaanyi aheaksa niny gwashita, ak ghwaraay gichea goodeeldeayda headaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eara heeda wagiida geenyarja, ak deareeda mida uhuuda heeda wagiida geehisa ng'eanyi, gawuurji giirooraneeda ghayi rugu siida ASEETA aba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha sugoocheanda siida ASEETA, “Mwaasha NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ak gimusiischooweani, gabiikseani geatindeanyu.” Hean ghamwaash siida ASEETA NG'UTAMIIDA; ak gabiiksa heedida geatinda sugoocheanda, ak gawuurji gida ghayi bea mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha sugoocheanda siida ASEETA, “Beeni gheenyu, ak gifuufi, ak gaydamwaarnyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha siida ASEETA sugoocheanda, “Inyas gigoonyean gheang'u eara ealach bugusta majeeteayeena jeeda. Nea eara mukaate ea mwaydaak ghana dali beega aba hiji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba ghayi geerukunean aba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, gideaba, ‘Adiidu giyaagi mukaate ghana leaha beega, gibiikteawi naweeda ghayi iyeadu.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikteawa nawa nuut, nea mudu gabiikteawa naweeda ghayi hina Beteli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sibaneeda waas bea Beteli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanda sibaneeda waas abiita Beteli. Ak ghapka orjoagaaschi headaanyi gwarukwiisa ng'asheega sean sin siida ASEETA eaweedida aba Beteli; eara ng'asheega rukusa sugoocheanda, ak gwarukusa saawa ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha ghweanda nyaawa saawa, “Naweeda aat aneeda gil?” Hean goohiimsa orjoagaaschi naweeda sik siida ASEETA leabu ng'eanyiida Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha orjoagaaschi, “Agooynean digeeda.” Hean geegooysa digeeda ak gwading'da badayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaat geeshta siida ASEETA, ak ghwanyasa guumda shaboogheecheanda nea goopteada; ng'ata gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i guwoosi siida ASEETA leabu ng'eanyiida Yudahi?” Hean ghwanya ghuuta ak gwayi, “Ea aniini gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Beeni gheenyu aga mukaate.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Majeamuusa eeteayeena, ghana eeweaya ghoah sea ang'iing'i, ak ea maydaak mukaate ghana dali beega sea ang'iing'i aba hiji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama sirukuneani aba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Adiidu gibiikteawi naweeda ghayi isku.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha niny, “Eara aniini geawuurjeeweey geawooschi sibaneeda, goobaloolan giijasoocheanda humng'eeda aba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gwayi, ‘Adeelni siisi jeedeaba gheang'u ghwaak mukaate nea ghwali beega.’” Nea ghana gwareengani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikta ghoah sea niny, ak ghwaak mukaate nea ghwali beega aba jeedeaba gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda abiitpiida aba murdeeda measa, ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda sibaneeda adeelu ghoah niny; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gooyeawusa siida ASEETA leabu ng'eanyiida Yuda, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Aba gideaba mudu sisiina mureeda ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea ea miing'waanyi diigheanda ghayi rukuneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea nibiigu bwadaw, ak giyaagi mukaate nea gileahi beega aba heeda ghayi eeshiineey, “Adiidu giyaagi mukaate ghana leaha beega”; saseadaang'u maygawa jeeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaagu.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoahiit agita mukaate ea leeshooda, ghaghu digeeda sibaneeda ghayi adeelu gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea gawa gwaroonyeesa ng'adiida jeeda naweeda ak ghwaak ng'adiida. Ak geejaksa mustaanyi jeeda naweeda, ak ghamiinaada digeeda aba murdeadaanyi; eara ng'adiida ghamiinaada aba murdeeda mustaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ging'ulayi, ghang'ata buuneeda aba hoowa, ak ghwadaah musta sijaksa jeeda naweeda, nea ghamiinaada ng'adiida aba murdeadaanyi. Hean ghapka gwarukuta aba jeeda mujiini heeda abiita sibaneeda waas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy sibaneeda adeelu ghoah siidida aba jeeda naweedean ng'asheanji, gwayi, “Nih siida ASEETA gil, mooleeysiina iit ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghamneawa ea niidaw NG'UTAMIIDA niny ng'adiida, ak ea niyaak ea gwanuus, gawuurji ng'asheanda abaloola NG'UTAMIIDA niny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha orjoagaaschi, “Agooynean digeeda.” Hean ghoaghu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa ak ghwanyasa mustaanyi nea sijaksa jeeda naweeda, nea digeeda ea ng'adiida ghamiinaada aba murdeeda musta. Nea ng'adiida ea miighwaak musta ghana ghwaak digeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageanu sibaneeda gwarasa badayda digeeda musta siida ASEETA, ak goodeelu jeeda mujiineeda haw gooyeawda ak gabuy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabung'sa musta jeeda bung'eadaanyi; hean gooyeawusa, nea gwayi, “Ea orjeeda giyeanya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea nihit bunyooda, gwayeesha orjoagaaschi, “Iyaameay, goobung'sean jeeda bung'eeda siida ASEETA, ayiina geakeasu murdeeda geakaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'asheega ghayi ayeawda bea NG'UTAMIIDA deaschi heeda wagiida aba Beteli, nea gwadeaschi gealga mida deageaw mida jeeda mujiinajeega Samariya, aba huumwa gaygang'atiida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        }
