        {
          "text": "Eara iing'ata ng'asheanji ea maduukuunana Yeroboamu naweadingaaschi munyas, ghwaloat ashoohoodiga gicha aba heeda siikghaambiit aba jeeda buuneesean; gilinyoo gagasa ghwaloat ghoah ashoohoodiga heeda ghaambiidaat. ",
          "type": "text",
